.* CFGCMN: the task menu for communications configuration.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CFGCMN'.
:IMPORT NAME=CFGTCP PNLGRP=QHTOCCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKDEVD PNLGRP=QHCFCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKLIND PNLGRP=QHDCLIN.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CFGCMN HELP=HLPCFGCMN KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Configure Communications and Remote Hardware
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP=WRKLIND OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKLIND'.Work with lines
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT2' OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCTLD'.Work with communications controllers
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCTLD'.Work with work station controllers
:MENUI HELP=WRKDEVD OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*CMN)'.Work with communications devices
:MENUI HELP=WRKDEVD OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*PRT)'.Work with printers
:MENUI HELP=WRKDEVD OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*DSP)'.Work with display stations
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT7' OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?WRKMODD'.Work with modes
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT8' OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCOSD'.Work with classes-of-service
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCFGL'.Work with configuration lists
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNWID'.Work with network interfaces
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCNNL'.Work with connection lists
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT12' OPTION=12 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNWSD'.Work with network servers
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT13' OPTION=13 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNTBD'.Work with NetBIOS descriptions
:MENUI HELP=CFGTCP OPTION=20 ACTION='CMD CFGTCP'.Configure TCP/IP
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT30' OPTION=30 ACTION='MENU CFGPCS'.Configure personal computer connections
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT40' OPTION=40 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNWSCFG'.Configure network server
:MENUI HELP='CFGCMN/OPT41' OPTION=41 ACTION='MENU NWSADM'.Network server administration
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCFGCMN.Configure Communications and Remote Hardware - Help
:P.The lines, controllers and devices that connect this system to others,
and TCP/IP. Options for functions this release does not have say so.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT2'.Work with communications controllers
:P.Option 2. Runs the WRKCTLD command&colon. Work with communications
controllers.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT3'.Work with work station controllers
:P.Option 3. Runs the WRKCTLD command&colon. Work with work station
controllers.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT7'.Work with modes
:P.Option 7. Runs the WRKMODD command&colon. Work with modes.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT8'.Work with classes-of-service
:P.Option 8. Runs the WRKCOSD command&colon. Work with
classes-of-service.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT9'.Work with configuration lists
:P.Option 9. Runs the WRKCFGL command&colon. Work with configuration
lists.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT10'.Work with network interfaces
:P.Option 10. Runs the WRKNWID command&colon. Work with network
interfaces.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT11'.Work with connection lists
:P.Option 11. Runs the WRKCNNL command&colon. Work with connection
lists.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT12'.Work with network servers
:P.Option 12. Runs the WRKNWSD command&colon. Work with network servers.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT13'.Work with NetBIOS descriptions
:P.Option 13. Runs the WRKNTBD command&colon. Work with NetBIOS
descriptions.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT30'.Configure personal computer connections
:P.Option 30. Shows menu CFGPCS&colon. Configure personal computer
connections.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT40'.Configure network server
:P.Option 40. Runs the WRKNWSCFG command&colon. Configure network
server.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGCMN/OPT41'.Network server administration
:P.Option 41. Shows menu NWSADM&colon. Network server administration.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
